sbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIMOTO, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIKAWA TAKAYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IWAMOTO KIYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI SHINICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KUBOTA NOBUHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ONISHI HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SANO YUKARI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SUGIYAMA JUN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YOSHIMOTO TAKESHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIKAWA, TAKAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IWAMOTO, KIYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, SHINICHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KUBOTA, NOBUHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ONISHI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SANO, YUKARI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGIYAMA, JUN</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YOSHIMOTO, TAKESHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An ink-jet recording sheet which is highly effective in preventing image photodeterioration such as a decrease in brightness or density and a change in color tone; and a resin composition for use in forming the ink-jet recording medium. The recording sheet comprises a base and formed thereon an ink-receiving layer comprising an acrylic resin obtained by copolymerizing (a) a dialkylaminoalkyl methacrylate, (b) acrylamide, and (c) at least one monomer selected among alkoxypolyethylene glycol methacrylates, 2-hydroxyalkyl methacrylates, and 2-hydroxyalkyl acrylates.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne une feuille sensible au jet d'encre qui est d'une grande efficacité pour prévenir une détérioration d'image due à la lumière, telle qu'une diminution de la clarté ou de la densité, et une modification des tons de couleur; et une composition de résine servant à former le support sensible au jet d'encre. La feuille sensible au jet d'encre comporte une base et une couche réceptrice d'encre formée sur celle-ci, ladite couche contenant une résine acrylique obtenue par copolymérisation de: (a) un méthacrylate de dialkylaminoalkyle, (b) un acrylamide, et (c) au moins un monomère sélectionné dans le groupe constitué par des méthacrylates d'alcoxypolyéthylèneglycol, des méthacrylates de 2-hydroxyalkyle, et des acrylates de 2-hydroxyalkyle.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>